## SQL Migrations

All 3 migrations run ✅

```sql
-- 1. Add passkey to core_users (6-digit, set by the user themselves)
ALTER TABLE core_users ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS passkey TEXT DEFAULT NULL;

-- 2. Add attention_required flag to vol_hours
ALTER TABLE vol_hours ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS attention_required BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE;

-- 3. Add attention_required flag to staff_hours
ALTER TABLE staff_hours ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS attention_required BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE;
```

