- System verifies approver is admin/super_user/manager and belongs to department
- Self-approval blocked
- Points calculated and logged on approval
- Passkey section in profile (admin/manager only) with show/hide and reset

### admin.html ✅
- Manager role can now access (isAdminRole includes manager)
- Manager sees only approvals — user manager, departments, activity log hidden
- My Dashboard button links to dashboard.html
