### activity_log.html ✅
- Badge number shown next to name for performed_by and target_user
- Edit entries show clean "Volunteer/Staff shift updated" instead of raw SQL
- Approved entries show target user, hours, and points
- Action filter fixed (points_add, edit)

### Supabase triggers updated ✅
- vol_hours_enforce_and_points: now allows passkey approvals, logs target_user_id + description + meta
