## Notes
- No PII collected from minors: phone, address, city, state, zip hidden in UI (columns remain in DB)
- Passkey: 6-digit numeric, per-user, stored in core_users.passkey — only admin/manager have one
- No image uploads for now; gallery picker may be added later
- volunteer.html and staff.html replaced by dashboard.html
- Points per hour hardcoded at 60 in trigger — should eventually use points_settings table
- Trigger uses auth.uid() for approver detection — passkey flow uses approved_by field instead